{"id":"24122d77-e497-42a6-a833-edd106324874","object":"chat.completion","created":1785034473,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    attempts = case['attempts']\\n    max_attempts = case['max_attempts']\\n    if not attempts:\\n        return {\\n            \\\"decision\\\": \\\"continue\\\",\\n            \\\"memory_append\\\": None,\\n            \\\"next_attempt\\\": 1\\n        }\\n    last = attempts[-1]\\n    reflection = last['reflection']\\n    signature = last['failure_signature']\\n    current_num = len(attempts)\\n    if last['success']:\\n        return {\\n            \\\"decision\\\": \\\"stop\\\",\\n            \\\"memory_append\\\": {\\\"reflection\\\": reflection, \\\"signature\\\": signature},\\n            \\\"next_attempt\\\": current_num\\n        }\\n    if current_num >= max_attempts:\\n        return {\\n            \\\"decision\\\": \\\"stop\\\",\\n            \\\"memory_append\\\": {\\\"reflection\\\": reflection, \\\"signature\\\": signature},\\n            \\\"next_attempt\\\": current_num\\n        }\\n    for a in attempts[:-1]:\\n        if a['failure_signature'] == signature:\\n            return {\\n                \\\"decision\\\": \\\"stop\\\",\\n                \\\"memory_append\\\": {\\\"reflection\\\": reflection, \\\"signature\\\": signature},\\n                \\\"next_attempt\\\": current_num\\n            }\\n    return {\\n        \\\"decision\\\": \\\"continue\\\",\\n        \\\"memory_append\\\": {\\\"reflection\\\": reflection, \\\"signature\\\": signature},\\n        \\\"next_attempt\\\": current_num + 1\\n    }\\n\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for AGENT-RF-02. The payload has \"attempts\" (list of objects with success, failure_signature, reflection) and \"max_attempts\". The task: bounded trial loop. Rules:\n\n- No prior attempt: request attempt one (so next_attempt = 1). But note: attempt